 ### Denoise-GS
-A self-supervised denoising method for sparse-view 3D Gaussian Splatting that combines unsupervised image denoising with explicitly differentiable 3DGS [S6]. It uses Noise2Void (N2V) to train a UNet for denoising, processes denoised images through InstantSplat for initialization, and fine-tunes the UNet in a second round [S6]. Unlike supervised methods, it requires no paired clean data [S6].
